myKnob.setLocalLookAndFeel(LookAndFeel.knob);
myButton.setLocalLookAndFeel(LookAndFeel.button);
```

**Large projects** — a dedicated `LookAndFeels/` directory with type-organized files (`SliderLAF.js`, `ButtonLAF.js`, etc.), each exporting a namespace. Complex instruments can end up with 20+ LAF objects covering dozens of draw functions.

