Getting Started

Apply CSS to components through `ScriptLookAndFeel`:

```javascript
const var laf = Content.createLocalLookAndFeel();

laf.setInlineStyleSheet("
button {
    background-color: #333333;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
}

button:hover {
    background-color: #555555;
}
");

