```


Renders a list of MIDI events to audio buffers on a background thread. Pass an array of MessageHolder objects created via `Engine.createMessageHolder()`. The callback receives a status object with `channels` (array of Buffer objects), `finished` (boolean), and `progress` (0.0 to 1.0).

::warning{title="New render replaces active render"}
Calling `renderAudio` while a render is in progress replaces the current render. The previous render's callback will not receive a final completion notification.
::

#### Render Midi To Audio (skipped)

```javascript
const var noteOn = Engine.createMessageHolder();
noteOn.setType(noteOn.cycleId);
noteOn.setNoteNumber(60);
noteOn.setVelocity(127);
noteOn.setChannel(1);

const var noteOff = Engine.createMessageHolder();
noteOff.setType(noteOff.cycleId);
noteOff.setNoteNumber(60);
noteOff.setVelocity(0);
noteOff.setChannel(1);
noteOff.setTimestamp(44100);

var eventList = [noteOn, noteOff];

inline function onRenderDone(status)
{
    if (status.finished)
    {
        Console.print("Render complete: " + status.channels.length + " channels");
    }
}

Engine.renderAudio(eventList, onRenderDone);
```

