name: decryptWithRSA
params:
  - { name: dataToDecrypt, type: String, desc: "Hex-encoded encrypted data string (base 16), as produced by `encryptWithRSA`." }
  - { name: publicKey, type: String, desc: "RSA public key string in JUCE's comma-separated format." }
---
::

```javascript
var plainText = FileSystem.decryptWithRSA(encryptedHex, publicKeyString);
```


Decrypts a hex-encoded string using an RSA public key and returns the original plaintext. The input must be a hexadecimal string as produced by `FileSystem.encryptWithRSA()`. This is a raw RSA operation - the maximum data size is limited by the RSA key size.

::warning{title="Returns empty string on failure"}
Returns an empty string silently when the key is invalid or when the decrypted data is not valid UTF-8. There is no error message to indicate failure - always check the return value.
::

