Applies a mirror transform to the canvas. When `horizontally` is `true`, the canvas is flipped left-to-right; when `false`, it is flipped top-to-bottom. The `totalArea` defines the axis of reflection - typically the full component bounds. All subsequent drawing operations are affected until the paint callback ends or another transform overrides it. Calling `flip` twice with the same direction restores the original orientation.

