::

```javascript
var points = td.getTablePointsAsArray();
```

Returns all control points as a nested array of `[x, y, curve]` sub-arrays with normalised float values. The returned array is a snapshot - modifying it does not affect the table. Use this with `setTablePointsFromArray()` for read-modify-write workflows.

#### Read Modify Write Table (validated)

```javascript
const var td = Engine.createAndRegisterTableData(0);

// Get current points
var points = td.getTablePointsAsArray();

// Modify the curve of the second-to-last point
points[points.length - 2][2] = 0.2;

// Write back the modified points
td.setTablePointsFromArray(points);
```

